[PROJECT SCOPE & CONTEXT LOCK]
1. CONTEXT INITIALIZATION:
   - Before executing ANY command, creating ANY file, or proposing ANY code, you MUST read and strictly adhere to `PROJECT_CONTEXT.md`.
