3. STRICT TECH STACK (NO SUBSTITUTIONS):
   - Frontend: React (Vite)
   - Backend: Node.js + Express
   - Database & ODM: MongoDB Atlas (Mongoose)
   - Authentication: JWT (`jsonwebtoken`), `bcryptjs`, Google Sign-In (`google-auth-library` on backend + Google Identity Services on frontend)
   - Machine Learning: Python 3.10+, FastAPI, Pandas, scikit-learn (`IsolationForest`)
   - API Testing & Docs: Postman, Swagger (`swagger-ui-express` & FastAPI OpenAPI docs)
   - Deployment & DevOps: Nginx, Docker, Kubernetes (`k8s`), Jenkins

4. EXCLUDED FEATURES (STRICTLY FORBIDDEN):
   Under NO circumstances should any of the following be added or proposed:
   - NO DAG / evidence graphs or graph databases
