   - NO Ollama, LLMs, Gemma, LangChain, or Generative AI
   - NO Evidence locking or chain-of-custody modules
   - NO Case builder or case management systems
   - NO Law-enforcement training features
   - NO Payments, subscriptions, or billing gateways
   - NO unlisted or invented features

5. SOURCE OF TRUTH & CODE GENERATION:
